            "notes": "## \ud83d\udd39 Round 2\n\n**\ud83d\uded2 Buy:**\n- [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) \n- [High Capacity Tubing](item_d4779a06-a19c-425d-80ff-159fde15a3f2) \n\n**\ud83e\udde0 Notes:**\n [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is a must. It\u2019s the key to basically unlimited energy. You fade, and your energy bar is full again. Simple as that.\n\nCombined with  [High Capacity Tubing](item_d4779a06-a19c-425d-80ff-159fde15a3f2), you get brutal synergy with [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) \u2013 you\u2019ll be pumping out free orbs constantly. This setup is what makes your healing engine go from decent to ridiculous.\n\nYou're not here to chase damage \u2013 you're here to farm bounty through nonstop, high-efficiency healing.\n\nIf you find it difficult to harvest enough bounty to be able to purchase both items, don't panic - just sell the green items. I can't stress how important  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is for a healing moira. Probably your most valued item, tbh.",
