            "notes": "## \ud83d\udd39 Round 5\n\n**\ud83d\uded2 Buy:**\n- [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) or [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953)  *(whichever you didn\u2019t take in Round 3)*\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) \n\n**\ud83e\udde0 Notes:**\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)  will let you build ult at an insane pace. With your current setup, you\u2019ll be feeding ult charge constantly just by doing your job.\n\nMake sure your secondary power complements the one from Round 3. If you already have Phantasm, take Potency here \u2013 and vice versa.\n\nIf you are meeting a really strong team I suggest that you pick  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) instead of  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4).\n\nYou can also go with  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) , if you are up against a team with a really strong healer.",
